{
    "title": "Yaomic - Yaoi Comics & Fiction",
    "description": "Greetings and a warm welcome to Yaomic, a dedicated platform for Yaoi enthusiasts, offering an\r\nexquisite collection of Yaoi comics and fiction. As we step into our third year, our community has\r\ngrown, enriched by an increasing number of talented Thai creators. We're committed to enriching\r\nyour experience with a wider array of quality content and advanced app features.\r\n\r\nYaomic now facilitates a variety of content unlocking methods for your convenience:\r\n\u2022 Unlock individual chapters with coins, ideal for selective readers.\r\n\u2022 Opt for one-time purchase tickets, unlocking the entirety of our content across all titles\r\nand chapters, valid for a month, quarter, or year (payable via QR code).\r\n\u2022 Enjoy unlimited access at a lower cost than tickets by subscribing to our automatic\r\nrenewal subscription.\r\n\r\nWe're also excited to offer:\r\n\u2022 Collectible high-resolution character images, perfect for phone wallpapers.\r\n\u2022 A diverse and intuitive search feature for an effortless browsing experience.\r\n\u2022 Optimal reading in both portrait and landscape modes, complete with smooth zoom and\r\nscroll functionalities.\r\n\u2022 An eye-friendly reading environment for fiction, featuring adjustable font sizes and\r\nbackground colors, complemented by easy-to-read paragraph formatting.\r\n\u2022 The ability to rate, share, and recommend your favorite titles.\r\n\u2022 A 'follow' feature to stay updated on new chapters of beloved titles.\r\n\u2022 Express your love for chapters with a 'heart' or bookmark them for future enjoyment.\r\n\u2022 Engage with chapters through comments and adorable stickers.\r\n\u2022 Offline reading capability, accessible with either reading tickets or an automatic renewal\r\nsubscription.\r\n\r\nAt Yaomic, we take immense pride in our app, crafted with passion by Thai developers and a\r\ndedicated editorial team, in collaboration with exceptional Thai creators. Their talent and drive\r\nrival that of international creators, inspiring us to deliver original, high-quality content. We share\r\nthis pride with you, our valued readers. Your joy and smiles while exploring Yaomic fuel our\r\npassion and commitment.\r\n\r\nStay connected with us, follow our journey, and continue to be the inspiration behind our\r\ncreations. Thank you for your unwavering support. ^^\r\n\r\nFacebook: Yaomicofficial\r\nInstagram: @yaomicofficial\r\nTwitter (X): @yaomicofficial\r\nWebsite: www.yaomic.com\r\n\r\nInquiries: hello@yaomic.com\r\nReports: support@yaomic.com\r\n\r\nDiscover delightful music~\r\nYouTube: @yaomicofficial",
    "descriptionHTML": "Greetings and a warm welcome to Yaomic, a dedicated platform for Yaoi enthusiasts, offering an<br>exquisite collection of Yaoi comics and fiction. As we step into our third year, our community has<br>grown, enriched by an increasing number of talented Thai creators. We&#39;re committed to enriching<br>your experience with a wider array of quality content and advanced app features.<br><br>Yaomic now facilitates a variety of content unlocking methods for your convenience:<br>\u2022 Unlock individual chapters with coins, ideal for selective readers.<br>\u2022 Opt for one-time purchase tickets, unlocking the entirety of our content across all titles<br>and chapters, valid for a month, quarter, or year (payable via QR code).<br>\u2022 Enjoy unlimited access at a lower cost than tickets by subscribing to our automatic<br>renewal subscription.<br><br>We&#39;re also excited to offer:<br>\u2022 Collectible high-resolution character images, perfect for phone wallpapers.<br>\u2022 A diverse and intuitive search feature for an effortless browsing experience.<br>\u2022 Optimal reading in both portrait and landscape modes, complete with smooth zoom and<br>scroll functionalities.<br>\u2022 An eye-friendly reading environment for fiction, featuring adjustable font sizes and<br>background colors, complemented by easy-to-read paragraph formatting.<br>\u2022 The ability to rate, share, and recommend your favorite titles.<br>\u2022 A &#39;follow&#39; feature to stay updated on new chapters of beloved titles.<br>\u2022 Express your love for chapters with a &#39;heart&#39; or bookmark them for future enjoyment.<br>\u2022 Engage with chapters through comments and adorable stickers.<br>\u2022 Offline reading capability, accessible with either reading tickets or an automatic renewal<br>subscription.<br><br>At Yaomic, we take immense pride in our app, crafted with passion by Thai developers and a<br>dedicated editorial team, in collaboration with exceptional Thai creators. Their talent and drive<br>rival that of international creators, inspiring us to deliver original, high-quality content. We share<br>this pride with you, our valued readers. Your joy and smiles while exploring Yaomic fuel our<br>passion and commitment.<br><br>Stay connected with us, follow our journey, and continue to be the inspiration behind our<br>creations. Thank you for your unwavering support. ^^<br><br>Facebook: Yaomicofficial<br>Instagram: @yaomicofficial<br>Twitter (X): @yaomicofficial<br>Website: www.yaomic.com<br><br>Inquiries: hello@yaomic.com<br>Reports: support@yaomic.com<br><br>Discover delightful music~<br>YouTube: @yaomicofficial",
